{# DP·C2 — where each department is read. Two readings of one model:
   the org-wide bucket every area inherits, and each area's own. #}
<div class="c">
    <span class="tab">Departments by scope<span class="src">&middot; where each one is read</span></span>
    {{ atlas_bars(scope.bars) }}
    <div class="rln"><span>Read in every area</span><span class="mono d">{{ scope.orgWide }} org-wide</span></div>
    <div class="rln"><span>Read in one area</span><span class="mono d">{{ scope.areaLevel }} area-level</span></div>
    <div class="rln"><span>Confining an org-wide department</span><span class="mono d">costs a reason &middot; narrows its positions, people and figures to that area</span></div>
    <div class="sxmore"><span>scope is changed on the department&rsquo;s own card</span><span class="sp"></span><a href="{{ path('team_departments') }}">The register &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
